  "body": "This applies the [specified changes](https://wicg.github.io/priority-hints/#html-integration) from the [Priority Hints spec](https://wicg.github.io/priority-hints/) to html for [#7150](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7150).\n\nThe main changes are:\n* Add a new `fetchpriority` attribute and `fetchPriority` IDL attribute to the `img`, `link`, `script` and `iframe` elements.\n* Plumb the attribute through to the underlying fetch for the resource associated with a given element.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chrome (Shipped in 103)\n   * [Mozilla](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1797715)\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) for all of the interfaces are already being run as part of the Priority Hints spec:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/priority-hints/\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=821464\n   * Gecko: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1797715\n   * WebKit: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=247291\n- [ ] [MDN](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests):\n   * Already documented as experimental from the existing spec, can be moved to non-experimental after merged:\n   \t* [img](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLImageElement/fetchPriority)\n   \t* [link](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLLinkElement/fetchPriority)\n   \t* [script](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLScriptElement)\n   \t* [iframe](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLIFrameElement/fetchPriority)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/embedded-content.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">/embedded-content.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/9f8e572...65c22f3/embedded-content.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/images.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">/images.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/9f8e572...65c22f3/images.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">/index.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/9f8e572...65c22f3/index.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">/indices.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/9f8e572...65c22f3/indices.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/9f8e572...65c22f3/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8470/9f8e572...65c22f3/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 17, 2023, 6:07 AM UTC (65c22f3)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://wh